!!
!! Control File for FSTR solver
!!
!! Checks that the SSOR preconditioner still gives the correct solution
!! when the relaxation parameter OMEGA is set to a value other than 1.0.
!!
!BOUNDARY
  FIX, 1, 3,   0.0
!CLOAD
  CL1,    3,  -1.0
!!
!! SOLVER CONTROL
!!
!SOLVER,METHOD=CG,PRECOND=1,ITERLOG=YES,TIMELOG=YES
 10000, 1
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 1.2
!WRITE,RESULT
!END
